    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p><strong>Amy Eddy</strong> is a Nonpartisan candidate for State Supreme Court (Seat 4) in Montana's 2026 election.</p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p><a href=\"https://amyeddyforjustice.com\">Campaign website</a></p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "heading2",
      "text": "Other candidates in this race",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<ul><li><a href=\"https://projects.montanafreepress.org/election-guide-2026/candidates/dan-wilson/\">Dan Wilson (NP)</a></li></ul>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "heading2",
      "text": "On the issues",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p>The responses reproduced here were solicited from candidates via a written questionnaire conducted by Montana Free Press in March 2026. Responses were limited to 1,000 characters and have not been edited or fact-checked.</p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p><em>No questionnaire response was provided.</em></p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "heading2",
      "text": "MTFP coverage",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p>No related coverage is listed.</p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "heading2",
      "text": "Campaign finance",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p>Campaign finance information for this race is not presented in the guide. State-level filings are available through the Montana Commissioner of Political Practices.</p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "heading2",
      "text": "Election outcomes",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "htmltable",
      "html": "<table>\n<caption>June 2 primary results for State Supreme Court (Seat 4)</caption>\n<thead><tr><th>Candidate</th><th>Party</th><th>Votes</th><th>Share</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>✓ AMY EDDY</td><td>NP</td><td>140,045</td><td>51.4%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>DAN WILSON</td><td>NP</td><td>132,411</td><td>48.6%</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
      "layout": "wide"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p><em>Count reported by the Montana secretary of state as of 6/12/2026 10:57:30 AM.</em></p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "heading2",
      "text": "About this project",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p>This guide was produced by the Montana Free Press newsroom with production by Tom Lutey, Brad Tyer, Amanda Eggert and Jacob Olness, web development by Jacob Olness, editing by Brad Tyer, and contributions from Mara Silvers, Zeke Lloyd and Stephanie Farmer. Contact Jacob Olness with questions, corrections or suggestions at jolness@montanafreepress.org.</p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p>Montana Free Press is a nonpartisan 501(c)(3) nonprofit, reader-supported news organization serving Montana. MTFP&#x27;s donor base includes supporters from across Montana&#x27;s political spectrum, including some Montanans who are candidates in this year&#x27;s election. MTFP&#x27;s <a href=\"https://montanafreepress.org/donor-transparency\">major donors are listed here</a>, and a current list of <a href=\"https://montanafreepress.org/mtfp-members/\">other supporters is available here</a>. MTFP news decisions are made without donor involvement.</p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<p>This material is available for republication by other media outlets under Montana Free Press&#x27; <a href=\"https://montanafreepress.org/publish-our-stories/\">standard distribution terms</a>.</p>",
      "format": "html",
      "layout": "body"
